      },
      "image": {},
      "text": {
        "format": 1,
        "content": "<p>This chapter has been written for the benefit of the players in the system. Wait, do I mean to say there's more to being a good player than showing up on time for a session?</p><p>Yes.</p><p>Let's go over how you can elevate your play, improve not only your enjoyment of the system but also everyone else's experience!</p>"
